  m_Name: 6 - Upgrade
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UtilityScriptIWrite::HintSO
  hintId: tutorial_upgrade
  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 1
  title: Upgrade System
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: 'You can unlock or improve multiple systems through the Upgrade menu.
    Some upgrades are multi-tiered and can be improved over time, while others are
    one-time unlocks that grant new abilities.


    To perform an upgrade, you must
    first meet its requirements. These may include completing other upgrades or finishing
    puzzle levels. In addition, each upgrade requires a sufficient amount of collected
    resources.


    Most importantly, you can repair your ship through the Upgrade
    System.'
  isImageBig: 0
